Why this AI doomsday warning from former Anthropic researcher broke through


Last week, researcher Jacob Coxon announced his resignation from Anthropic,=
 stating that AI =E2=80=98could kill us all by the end of the decade=E2=80=
=99


Jacob Coxon had insider access to both Anthropic and OpenAI, where he worke=
d for five years. Photograph: Chris Ratcliffe/Bloomberg via Getty Images


Blake Montgomery
https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.wtfWA9uPAn8i7Lb0U_hU2kE-=
