Transformer newsletter
on AI. =E2=80=9CThe best way I=E2=80=99ve had it explained to me is that we=
=E2=80=99re trying to build something that=E2=80=99s smarter than us in the=
 way we=E2=80=99re smarter than monkeys. Our existence hasn=E2=80=99t gone =
