<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">If the US and China can=E2=80=99t agree on=
 AI regulation, it=E2=80=99s unlikely any AI regulation at all will come.</=
p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">A decade of dire warnings have failed to s=
low the pace of the AI industry. As today=E2=80=99s freak-out cools, the po=
litical response seems to be moving the same way.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Trump is calling AI doomsday warnings =E2=
=80=9Ca HOAX=E2=80=9D. Should a safety bill arrive on his desk, it seems un=
likely he would sign it.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: <a href=3D"https://abli=
nk.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszc=
CSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFeZa-0VRWGhiVL_5ljFrPCkHq0wvY1NlX3PpaEMOVRFANQ9_Q=
0pLZnVFiygokj9ngELW-saBbdTsSQg_xGDoIxP4p97Za-LZKWJdW9izeO8QyklO4gC34qZ-24yN=
zGuWaFqlYWiod33C23NYQUjPMyv-J6hFEArs1urTg2wuyIWSlk4qvvWU0Dq5mo2Qa3rDWSqmfc_=
Ct5WYsE9W4uU19rs-fhCEZHskLTrSv4Gz0LZ-MACUNYeQSN-eqRoSHzPEik/4u9/xFL0NGw6Tou=
bgMNOhI1e0Q/h16/h001.9qny458Tp8mj4unHsyhlXjRLtyKnT6RjZLF7OyzwwXU" style=3D"=
color: #0077B6;">=E2=80=98Godfather of AI=E2=80=99 says tech regulation is =
nearing Covid-style pivot moment</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Though the Vermont senator Bernie Sanders =
has promised to propose a prohibition on extremely capable AI, no bill will=
 pass both chambers of the US Congress in the near future. Last week, the H=
ouse speaker, Mike Johnson, dismissed the chamber early for its seven-week =
midterm campaigning recess, likely preventing meaningful progress on AI saf=
ety legislation while the nation is focused on the issue.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CIt is just beyond the pale that M=
ike Johnson has called off Congress,=E2=80=9D said the representative Yassa=
min Ansari, a Democrat from Arizona, on CNN. =E2=80=9CWe=E2=80=99re going h=
ome for seven weeks. And during that time, we=E2=80=99re going to see this =
frontier AI technology continue to evolve, continue to cause damage. And it=
=E2=80=99s going to get to a point where it will be impossible to go backwa=
rd if we don=E2=80=99t move quickly now.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: <a href=3D"https://abli=
nk.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszc=
CSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFekHoYWHGK6C9X1yHKjCbOyn1AgWnpQvZLOIo2y_NFBfRMDbE=
jK6oXipQ2lZ9T2W97Dx8TkQoALtT4qXkESokChnrDn_r5W-kVd-IFDEdwMDNrgCMpl5A8yQYBJe=
Ed7R1t3e9He-ScSUiBCL7-uGheRkYn4wYL-gLm8VzUW4mI82FjRTMtPnN5B1UWLYei9y9zly1IC=
aMYmJ4ymGq8iDID3w/4u9/xFL0NGw6ToubgMNOhI1e0Q/h17/h001.UmAxYprLJDlAWqCZn9ejV=
4U4_qVEJQrnyDGgsu6Z2is" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Why a decade of doomsday =
warnings failed to slow the AI race</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The AI industry is not united in its calls=
 for regulation, dampening the possibility further. Though Amodei and OpenA=
I=E2=80=99s Sam Altman have invited new restrictions, and they nearly came =
to a <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLME=
mFuifc_XG18IR4O_n3e_X2OrRJNJpWj78L-keuI4OpSRBzS6-LNfAGhb4xb9wcPCCPAmJbzvLyS=
lEXFy0P0Y6LQ4B9ONYEOsdkmPWhrYp2vSot7eVfhdPU_UcUyIHIwWaYkrs3EbQQrvmuvOaw4OJq=
e3EQ8yI0JMWr1NbC4g2dnW-TPHBI8R3TwjvkfTiRplc4jVBydKQQl2wSWGrxqtesx2vnNSNQBdc=
E2_QFUfJrYcx-etBpvd4DIZMdjFRZzEMWMpCtpn0SlVbsEpdOFeD4aLfuQjWijsabQ/4u9/xFL0=
NGw6ToubgMNOhI1e0Q/h18/h001.UDKRHkYcWR8IuJDU8TXaqmBfSjZOaaqteASvNpyZxyA" st=
yle=3D"color: #0077B6;">joint legally binding safety testing agreement</a>,=
 they are but one powerful faction within their business. Nvidia=E2=80=99s =
Jensen Huang has Trump=E2=80=99s ear, as does the influential adviser David=
 Sacks; both are in favor of accelerating AI development.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Huang said on Sunday that =E2=80=9C2030 is=
 not going to be the end of the world. There is 0% chance that=E2=80=99s go=
ing to be the end of the world. Scaring people is unnecessary. It is irresp=
onsible.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: <a href=3D"https://abli=
nk.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszc=
CSneHECyyyKiIcsbT_mvO_CmKOtXSKF9jHoW88niaLMYmYAGj7i4xNiyQxhL8te4fAA1fqz4vW9=
hF39llzTDTjMrduINZN5bu4sK8-p2vjXK6qSnV1XrHVnRcU1YFVLTytVF9lK7wNkPOVCtzpSiTV=
oc0cnKrMREVJE1DV-LLyOQupxXB7R9hqAKXJMkTJs82Rf5uIbspY8o1RiuNz7w1m2m9JDD05Xdw=
JvRA853eLwcu-c3Rg/4u9/xFL0NGw6ToubgMNOhI1e0Q/h19/h001.wvj9GCi-rvQN1XxeB1Ebe=
STzJd2Q0FJh4yIidZTUL3o" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">=E2=80=98An out-of-touch =
Silicon Valley radical=E2=80=99: meet Trump=E2=80=99s AI whisperer pushing =
for limited regulation</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Europe, which has played the role of globa=
l tech regulator, has little leverage in the debate despite its high concer=
n for safety. Ursula Von der Leyen invited frontier labs to discussions in =
Europe about pacing the frontier of development, which garnered little resp=
onse.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: <a href=3D"https://abli=
nk.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszc=
CSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFexEyBUMplC5cLvFgG1R5fRmt_adhpXhsQoeNPpTQPcIGhRrO=
UQmpMekKcIbEPSeeILD7uxgnJvb4vi0IgFcUwGkY0x8Rry5geChBBwEKn_KPHSh8MauMxcbGr13=
uuHDf_yaX0K_f4zhJXjotVZXdojpDkh21FdkEl0-jCQv2pcBnKSHNJ4fLu3CWLX1SZ6vZMhH9Jj=
m0IAtXP9mcoc3wFFQ/4u9/xFL0NGw6ToubgMNOhI1e0Q/h20/h001.zKPwn0UJwUhDAqeggThgs=
TLPewtmuDZANgsscJwoWZg" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Why Europe has been absen=
t from the great AI safety debate</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In 2023, Geoffrey Hinton, a so-called =E2=
=80=9Cgodfather of AI=E2=80=9D and a Nobel laureate, left Google over his o=
wn fears of the risks that AI could be used by bad actors and one day harm =
humanity. Unlike many whistleblowers, Hinton=E2=80=99s resignation inspired=
 a significant response from lawmakers: an executive order in the US, a con=
gressional hearing and the passage of the EU=E2=80=99s AI Act.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Yoshua Bengio, another godfather of AI, to=
ld the Guardian much the same last week. Bengio said governments are nearin=
g a Covid-esque moment of rapid action. He=E2=80=99s =E2=80=9Cmore optimist=
ic than many observers because I see the public moving=E2=80=9D, he said.</=
p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Bengio preached his optimism after the Can=
adian and German governments announced funding of up to =C2=A3160m for his =
non-profit organisation, which is dedicated to creating an =E2=80=9Chonest =
AI=E2=80=9D that will act as a guardrail against rogue agents.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">I would likewise be optimistic if I were h=
anded =C2=A3160m. Without such a payout, I am not.</p>
